Package: krypton-adblock
Version: 2.4.0-beryllium
Architecture: all
Section: net/privacy
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Krypton Security Team <security@krypton-os.org>
Installed-Size: 512
Depends: krypton-browser (>= 1.0), coreutils (>= 9.0)
Provides: adblock, krypton-adblock
Command-Binary: /usr/bin/adblock
Config-File: /etc/adblock.conf
Homepage: https://krypton-os.org/adblock
Description: High-performance DNS and network ad blocker for KryptonOS
 Provides system-wide network ad filtering, tracker sinkholing, and intrusive
 banner prevention for KryptonOS and the built-in quantum browser engine.
 Integrates directly with /etc/adblock.conf and installs the /usr/bin/adblock utility.
